年，公子范襲邯鄲，不勝而死。四年，朝天子。六年，攻齊，拔髙唐。七年，公子刻攻魏首垣。十一年，秦孝公使商君伐魏，虜其將公子卬。趙伐魏。十二年，秦孝公卒，商君死。十五年，起壽陵。魏惠王卒。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示姓名、是為與連續事件；太戊午／大戊午暫接但字形待底本核查。娃嬴／孟姚／惠后按本段明示暫接，不與先前夢辭孟姚按同名合併；王紲與較早公子紲分候選。君王職稱按各國上下文辨別，不全域匹配。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p055","text":"肅侯元年，奪晉君端氏，徙處屯留。二年，與魏惠王遇於陰晉。三年，公子范襲邯鄲，不勝而死。四年，朝天子。六年，攻齊，拔髙唐。七年，公子刻攻魏首垣。十一年，秦孝公使商君伐魏，虜其將公子卬。趙伐魏。十二年，秦孝公卒，商君死。十五年，起壽陵。魏惠王卒。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m055-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"肅侯","kind":"person","person_id":"txj_z8z_5me","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m055-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"晉君","kind":"person","person_id":"lhy_fkp_0h5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m055-0020","start":20,"end":23,"surface":"魏惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"hob_fsb_jia","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m055-0031","start":31,"end":34,"surface":"公子范","kind":"person","person_id":"3u1_ov8_6ry","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m055-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"天子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、夢中女子或待核官稱／親稱保留；不從同名、國號與未名先王補個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m055-0063","start":63,"end":66,"surface":"公子刻","kind":"person","person_id":"uo0_7bg_poy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m055-0075","start":75,"end":78,"surface":"秦孝公","kind":"person","person_id":"xkn_0tx_45l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m055-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"商君","kind":"person","person_id":"w6w_2q4_c9g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m055-0087","start":87,"end":90,"surface":"公子卬","kind":"person","person_id":"7j8_d3i_ond","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m055-0099","start":99,"end":102,"surface":"秦孝公","kind":"person","person_id":"xkn_0tx_45l","status":